{"id":"651756","name":"椒香花卷","author":"诗韵墨香","authorId":"10606182","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/651756/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"500克"},{"name":"酵母","amount":"5克"}],"sub":[{"name":"清水","amount":"260克"},{"name":"椒盐","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/651756/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"制作方法：面和好醒面15分钟，擀长片，面坯刷少许油，撒少许面粉，撒适量椒盐。","img":"images/651756/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"从一边叠起。","img":"images/651756/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"切等量剂子。","img":"images/651756/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"两个小剂子叠加在一起。","img":"images/651756/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"用筷子在中间按压一下，不要压断。","img":"images/651756/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"抻一抻，拧一下剂子，两端对折，按压紧实。","img":"images/651756/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"醒发一倍大，大火上锅蒸15分钟。","img":"images/651756/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"时间到，关火焖1分钟。","img":"images/651756/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/651756/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/651756/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/651756/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"成品图。","img":"images/651756/step_13.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：蒸锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}